      "id": 4333533,
      "name": "Specialized Blade of the Other: Rush",
      "desc": "When equipped, this item grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Phase Dash Enhancement] \nEnhancement I: If the target has an enhanced Cacophony Shield, the Shield is reduced by an additional <color=#2BAD00>100%/50%/30%</color> for normal/elite/boss enemies, respectively. Powerful Slash increases Daze buildup against normal/elite/boss enemies that have not entered combat by an additional <color=#2BAD00>100%/30%/15%</color>, respectively.\n\nEnhancement II: Defeating a boss enemy restores 1 use of Blade of the Other.\n\nAgainst enemies at <color=#CF4029>Lv. 60 or higher</color>, <color=#CF4029>Powerful Slash</color> deals <color=#CF4029>50%</color> less DMG.",
